; The test harness runs ledger with --args-only, which reads no init file,
; not even one named with --init-file, so this test only shows that the
; option is accepted.  test/CheckEnvVars.py checks that each way of naming
; an init file reads it.

2012-03-17 Quick
    Expenses:Food                12,50 €
    Assets:Cash

test --init-file test/baseline/opt-init-file.dat bal
            -12,50 €  Assets:Cash
             12,50 €  Expenses:Food
--------------------
                   0
end test
